a primitive root;
to be (causatively, make) sharp or (figuratively) severe
KJV: be fierce, sharpen.

H2301.definition:
from H2300 (חָדַד); fierce;
Chadad, an Ishmaelite
KJV: Hadad.

H2302.definition:
a primitive root;
to rejoice
KJV: make glad, be joined, rejoice.

H2303.definition:
from H2300 (חָדַד);
a point
KJV: sharp.

H2304.definition:
from H2302 (חָדָה);
rejoicing
KJV: gladness, joy.

H2306.definition:
