H2319.definition:
from H2318 (חָדַשׁ);
new
KJV: fresh, new thing.

H2320.definition:
from H2318 (חָדַשׁ);
the new moon; by implication, a month
KJV: month(-ly), new moon.

H2321.definition:
the same as H2320 (חֹדֶשׁ);
Chodesh, an Israelitess
KJV: Hodesh.

H2322.definition:
feminine of H2319 (חָדָשׁ); new;
Chadashah, a place in Palestine
KJV: Hadashah.

H2323.definition:
