KJV: circle, circuit, compass.

H2330.definition:
a primitive root;
properly, to tie a knot, i.e. (figuratively) to propound a riddle
KJV: put forth.

H2331.definition:
a primitive root; (compare H2324 (חֲוָא), H2421 (חָיָה));
