to hurry; figuratively, to be eager with excitement or enjoyment
KJV: (make) haste(-n), ready.

H2364.definition:
from H2363 (חוּשׁ); haste;
Chushah, an Israelite
KJV: Hushah.

H2365.definition:
from H2363 (חוּשׁ); hasty;
Chushai, an Israelite
KJV: Hushai.

H2366.definition:
or חֻשִׁים; or חֻשִׁם; plural from H2363 (חוּשׁ); hasters;
